BT
/F1 9 Tf
0.1 0.1 0.15 rg
55 475 Td
(  * Example: A reading of 124/86 mmHg is classified as STAGE 1 HYPERTENSION \(due to diastolic >=80\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
0.1 0.1 0.15 rg
55 462 Td
